data_LLZO_tetragonal_reduced
# REDUCED FIXTURE — NOT a real LLZO primitive cell.
# Real tetragonal Li7La3Zr2O12 (LLZO) is space group I41/acd (#142),
# conventional cell ~13.07 Å × 13.07 Å × 12.66 Å, 8 formula units (192 atoms).
# This fixture preserves the *tetragonal distortion* (a != c) of the real
# phase while remaining a 24-atom representation suitable as a fixture.
#
# Tetragonal LLZO is the LOW-conductivity phase (~1e-6 S/cm at RT,
# vs cubic ~1e-3 S/cm); the cubic-vs-tetragonal contrast is the canonical
# "known-good control" the PRD requires (PRD §Scope: "Recover literature
# behavior while distinguishing cubic high-conductivity LLZO from
# tetragonal low-conductivity behavior").
#
# Same disclaimer as cubic/structure.cif: positions are stoichiometrically
# correct illustrative seed positions, NOT relaxed Wyckoff sites. For real
# work, fetch from Materials Project mp-942790 (tetragonal LLZO) or the
# cited primary source.
#
# Sources:
#   - Awaka, J. et al. J. Solid State Chem. 182(8), 2046–2052 (2009).
#     DOI: 10.1016/j.jssc.2009.05.020 (tetragonal LLZO crystallography).
#   - Materials Project entry mp-942790 (tetragonal LLZO).
_cell_length_a 13.070
_cell_length_b 13.070
_cell_length_c 12.660
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 90.0
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
